// A boiler's ash door opens on whichever side has room. Built with rock hard against its right side, its ash comes
// out on the left (here into its sump, where the light ash floats) instead of into the rock (before, it was put
// inside the rock and lost there).
map
########################################
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#...........##.........................#
#...........##.........................#
#...........##.........................#
#...........##.........................#
#...........##.........................#
######......##.........................#
#wwwww......##.........................#
#wwwww......##.........................#
#wwwww......##.........................#
#wwwww......##......@..................#
########################################
########################################
end
give Boiler 1
place 2 -11 -2 Boiler
drop 10 Coal -13 -6
expect 2600 items:Ash == 1
expect 2600 zone:Ash,-19,-15,-4,0 == 1     // out on the left, by the sump
expect 2600 zone:Ash,-9,-6,-6,0 == 0       // not in the rock on the right
